_:r9815b95da76878a070d70ed3_n6cd6d665e8cb4102bad25f4973484469b17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The brain imaging data structure, a format for organizing and describing outputs of neuroimaging experiments" .
