_:rf22bac21705da27627d3081f_n8c9ee9b5b0cd4ebe904667b89a09f7d5b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> .
